<p>Each time a creature affected by vimsense hurts you, you regain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.70, 3.10, 4.32, 5.44, 6.50</acronym> vim and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4.00, 7.20, 10, 13, 15</acronym> health.</p>